    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a decent start but it feels a bit generic. i need more ammo for a competitive round. can you dig deeper into the psychological or social side? like, instead of just saying \"it might hurt work ethic,\" can you give me some harder-hitting arguments about how it destroys the dignity of work or creates a culture of dependency? i want stuff that's really hard for the pro-UBI kids to wiggle out of.",
